    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the streets as mercenary Bianna in the cyberpunk-inspired city of Ark. Move forward and face the city's dark realities with the help of your best friend Rodante.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can perform 7 attacks with a total of 7 types of guns! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can perform various actions such as double jumping, wall climbing, and rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A total of 6 unique stages are prepared, excluding the tutorial!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 40 types of enemies attack you in a variety of ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Entrust your ears to addictive synthwave music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Watch the witty conversation between the main characters Bianna and Rodante!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the streets as mercenary Bianna in the cyberpunk-inspired city of Ark. Move forward and face the city's dark realities with the help of your best friend Rodante.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can perform 7 attacks with a total of 7 types of guns! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can perform various actions such as double jumping, wall climbing, and rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A total of 6 unique stages are prepared, excluding the tutorial!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 40 types of enemies attack you in a variety of ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Entrust your ears to addictive synthwave music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Watch the witty conversation between the main characters Bianna and Rodante!</p>",
    "short_description": "Reblica is a cyberpunk-style action platformer shooting game. In Ark, a city full of chaos and crime, become the mercenary Bianna, defeat various enemies and complete quests.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean",
